                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "component",
                    "name": "SectionLabel",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Why revenue lives elsewhere in this model.",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#1A1A1A",
                        "fontSize": 22,
                        "fontWeight": "bold",
                        "lineHeight": 1.2,
                        "marginBottom": 8,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "The nursing ROI story is a quality and workforce story.",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#666666",
                        "fontSize": 12,
                        "marginBottom": 12,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "In the physician and APP care settings, ambient documentation creates a measurable revenue story — wRVU capture, DRG accuracy, denial prevention. For nursing, the picture is different: nursing documentation primarily informs care decisions and shapes labor outcomes rather than driving the revenue cycle, so the financial impact shows up in quality and workforce instead of billing.",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#666666",
                        "fontSize": 10.5,
                        "lineHeight": 1.5,
                        "marginBottom": 12,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "This model focuses on the value drivers where nursing has the strongest, most defensible footprint: the QUALITY bucket (preventable harm events, sepsis bundle compliance) and the WORKFORCE bucket (retention, agency cost avoidance, overtime reduction). Keeping the revenue narrative with the care settings that actually drive billing makes both stories more credible.",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#666666",
                        "fontSize": 10.5,
                        "lineHeight": 1.5,
                        "marginBottom": 12,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "The Indirect Connection",
                          },
                        ],
                        "kind": "primitive",
                        "props": {
                          "style": {
                            "color": "#EA2C00",
                            "fontSize": 9,
                            "fontWeight": "bold",
                            "letterSpacing": 1.5,
                            "marginBottom": 6,
                            "textTransform": "uppercase",
                          },
                        },
                        "tag": "TEXT",
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "Complete nursing documentation does create downstream organizational value: HCAHPS performance affects Value-Based Purchasing scores. HAC scores affect Medicare payment rates. Sepsis SEP-1 compliance affects public reporting and payer relationships. These flow through the model as quality outcomes rather than revenue line items — which keeps the framing both honest and defensible.",
                          },
                        ],
                        "kind": "primitive",
                        "props": {
                          "style": {
                            "color": "#666666",
